<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysian Mosaics 6-mth net up 7.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysian Mosaics 6-mth net up 7.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to July 31</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		18.90	 vs	   17.54</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	6.9	  vs	    6.4</p>
<p>    Turnover		 324.90	 vs	  255.46</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  56.71	 vs	   31.90</p>
<p>    Minorities    less    22.11	 vs   less   8.00</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	  3.06	 vs	   nil</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	 2.5	  vs	    2.5</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Malaysian Mosaics Bhd. It makes and sells mosaic and ceramic floor tiles and is also involved in plantations.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
